      <activity id="9e0ac9c1-0654-5818-9c62-37e8c1af5d53" activityNameId="e4319bde-fb84-5753-8c78-06d2f2b6c05f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer system, cast iron pipe, DN 300, profile 1</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer system, cast iron pipe, DN 300, profile 1
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: e025e4f9-2224-4d25-bff5-af98209d7156
This process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with  cast iron pipe, DN 300, profile 1 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with cast iron pipe.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Complete sewer system, DN 300, profile 1 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Cast iron pipe, 300 mm, outer diameter 319 mm, wall thickness 9.6 mm, 67 kg/m, 7200 kg/m³. A1-A5 and C1-C4
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e025e4f9-2224-4d25-bff5-af98209d7156.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
