        <name xml:lang="en">Sewer system, construction, cast iron pipe, DN 300, profile 1</name>
        <unitName xml:lang="en">meter</unitName>
        <comment xml:lang="en">Full flow name: Sewer system, construction, cast iron pipe, DN 300, profile 1
(2,2,1,1,1,4,BU:3); 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with cast iron pipe, DN 300, profile 1 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3) and the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) for one linear meter of installed ductile cast iron pipe, including trench excavation and backfilling.; Construction method according to SIA 190, material parameters based on competence centre (cc) Kanalisation, VSA Arbeitsgruppe Materialwahl, transport distances estimated average distances in Switzerland. Construction and use of building machines based on "Maschinenstunden" (Machine hours) standard analysis in the TB-Viewer of the Schweizerischer Baumeisterverband (Swiss Contractors Association) 
BAFU mapping audit: {"bafu source exchange index": 1}</comment>
        <uncertainty>
          <lognormal meanValue="1.0" varianceWithPedigreeUncertainty="0.3047027640425884" mu="0.0"/>
        </uncertainty>
